# Proposed sensor-01 desired state:
#   VM ID: 201
#   IPv4:  192.168.2.55/24
#   Node:  PROXMOX
#   Disk:  local-lvm, 80 GiB
#   CPU:   4 vCPU
#   RAM:   6144 MiB
#
# Both VM ID and IPv4 must pass a live unused-resource preflight before apply.
#
# Supply secrets through the environment, never this file:
#
# export TF_VAR_proxmox_api_token='iac@pve!opentofu=...'
#
# The controller SSH public key is consumed by the Ansible hypervisor
# prerequisite which installs the sensor-01 cloud-init snippet.
#
# The future USB capture NIC is intentionally absent from initial Terraform.
# Add its stable passthrough identity only after the hardware arrives and is
# positively identified on PROXMOX.
